# Environment variables
.env
# A developer's personal local overrides, never committed. Scoped to src/main so it
# doesn't also match src/test/resources/application-local.properties, which is a
# shared, secret-free file committed on purpose (see its own header comment).
src/main/resources/application-local.properties

# Private keys, certificates, keystores — none exist in this repo today, but nothing
# should ever silently start tracking one if a TLS/signing use case is added later.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore


